{"yeu/sths": {"key": "yeu/sths", "head": "ψεύστης", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψεύστης ὁ [ψευσ-, ψεύδομαι.] A liar : ψεῦσταί τʼ ὀρχησταί τε <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"261\">Il. 24.261</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yia/s": {"key": "yia/s", "head": "ψιάς", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψιάς -άδος, ἡ. A drop <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"459\">Il. 16.459</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yilo/s": {"key": "yilo/s", "head": "ψιλός", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψιλός -ή, -όν. Bare: ἄροσιν (freed from trees or other encumbrances, cleared) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"580\">Il. 9.580</a> : νῆα ψιλὴν φέρε κῦμα (her timbers gone) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"12\" data-line=\"421\">Od. 12.421</a>, δέρμα (stripped of the hair) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"13\" data-line=\"437\">Od. 13.437</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "ya/maqos": {"key": "ya/maqos", "head": "ψάμαθος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψάμαθος -ου, ἡ [cf. ἄμαθος and ψάμμος.] 1 Sand : ὡς ὅτε τις ψάμαθον πάϊς [ἐρείπῃ] (a sand-castle) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"362\">Il. 15.362</a> : ψαμάθῳ εἰλυμένα Od. 14.136. In pl. in sim. sense : αὐτόν μιν εἰλύσω ψαμάθοισιν Il. 21.319. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"7\" data-line=\"462\">Il. 7.462</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"12\" data-line=\"31\">Il. 12.31</a>. 2 Sand as commonly occurring by the sea or by rivers, the sand, the sands : ἐπὶ ψαμάθῳ ἔθεσαν Od. 13.119. In pl. : νῆα ἔρυσσαν ἐπὶ ψαμάθοις Il. 1.486. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"202\">Il. 21.202</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"15\">Il. 23.15</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"853\">853</a> : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"38\">Od. 3.38</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"426\">Od. 4.426</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"438\">438</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"539\">539</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"546\">Od. 9.546=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"12\" data-line=\"5\">Od. 12.5</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"13\" data-line=\"284\">Od. 13.284</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"387\">Od. 22.387</a>. The particles considered separately with reference to their number : ὅσα ψάμαθός τε κόνις τε <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"385\">Il. 9.385</a>. In pl. : ψαμάθοισιν [ἐοικότες] <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"2\" data-line=\"800\">Il. 2.800</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yedno/s": {"key": "yedno/s", "head": "ψεδνός", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψεδνός -ή, -όν. Sparse, scanty, thin : λάχνη <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"2\" data-line=\"219\">Il. 2.219</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yeuste/w": {"key": "yeuste/w", "head": "ψευστέω", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψευστέω [ψεύστης.] = ψεύδομαι 3 : ψευστήσεις (the event will falsify your boast) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"19\" data-line=\"107\">Il. 19.107</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yeu=dos": {"key": "yeu=dos", "head": "ψεῦδος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψεῦδος τό [ψεύδομαι.] 1 A falsehood, lie, piece of deceit : ψ. κεν φαῖμεν Il. 2.81= <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"222\">Il. 24.222</a>, γνώμεναι εἴ τε ψ. ὑπόσχεσις (whether he promised only to deceive) Il. 2.349. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"276\">Il. 21.276</a> : <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"20\">Od. 3.20 =</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"328\">328</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"366\">Od. 11.366</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"296\">Od. 14.296</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"387\">387</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"19\" data-line=\"203\">Od. 19.203</a>. In pl., sharp practice : ψεύδεσσι βιησάμενος <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"576\">Il. 23.576</a>. An oath-breaking (cf. ψεύδομαι 2). In pl. : ψεύδεσσιν ἀρωγός (an abettor in oath-breaking) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"235\">Il. 4.235</a> (u.l. ψευδέσσιν; see ψευδής). 2 An inaccurate, incorrect or erroneous statement : οὔ τι ψ. ἐμὰς ἄτας κατέλεξας (all you have said is but the truth) <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"115\">Il. 9.115</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yau/w": {"key": "yau/w", "head": "ψαύω", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψαύω (ἐπι-) 1 To be so close together as to touch, to touch : ψαῦον κόρυθες φάλοισιν Il. 13.132= <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"216\">Il. 16.216</a>. 2 To come into contact with, bring something into contact with, touch. With genit. : ψαύουσιν ἐπισσώτρου τρίχες <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"519\">Il. 23.519</a>, ὸππότερός κε ψαύσῃ ἐνδίνων 806.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yuxro/s": {"key": "yuxro/s", "head": "ψυχρός", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψυχρός -ή, -όν [ψύχω.] Cold : νιφάδες Il. 19.358. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"171\">Il. 15.171</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"152\">Il. 22.152</a> : αὔρη Od. 5.469. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"392\">Od. 9.392</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"477\">Od. 14.477</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"17\" data-line=\"209\">Od. 17.209</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"19\" data-line=\"388\">Od. 19.388</a>. Of the bronze of a weapon : ψυχρὸν ἕλε χαλκὸν ὀδοῦσιν <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"75\">Il. 5.75</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "ya/r": {"key": "ya/r", "head": "ψάρ", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψάρ ψήρ A starling <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"583\">Il. 16.583</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"17\" data-line=\"755\">Il. 17.755</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yu/xw": {"key": "yu/xw", "head": "†ψύχω", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">†ψύχω Aor. pple. fem. ψύξασα. (ἀνα-, ἀπο-) To breathe, blow : ἦκα ψύξασα <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"20\" data-line=\"440\">Il. 20.440</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yeuda/ggelos": {"key": "yeuda/ggelos", "head": "ψευδάγγελος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψευδάγγελος -ον [ψεῦδος + ἄγγελος.] Falsifying one&#x27;s message <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"15\" data-line=\"159\">Il. 15.159</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yuxh/": {"key": "yuxh/", "head": "ψυχή", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψυχή -ῆς, ἡ. 1 The animating principle, the vital spirit, the soul, the life, life, one&#x27;s life (cf. θυμός I.1.b) : λύθη ψυχή τε μένος τε Il. 5.296= <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"123\">Il. 8.123=</a><a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"8\" data-line=\"315\">315. Cf</a>. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"334\">Il. 11.334</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"569\">Il. 21.569</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"257\">Il. 22.257</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"325\">325</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"338\">338</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"467\">467</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"104\">Il. 23.104</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"754\">Il. 24.754</a> : κεκαδήσει θυμοῦ καὶ ψυχῆς Od. 21.154, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"171\">171. Cf</a>. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"523\">Od. 9.523</a>. In pl. in reference to a number of persons : ψυχὰς ὀλέσαντες Il. 13.763= <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"168\">Il. 24.168. Cf</a>. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"444\">Od. 22.444</a>. 2 Animate existence viewed as a possession, one&#x27;s life : ἐμὴν ψυχὴν παραβαλλόμενος Il. 9.322, ψυχῆς ἀντάξιον <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"401\">401</a> : ψυχὰς παρθέμενοι Od. 3.74= <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"255\">Od. 9.255</a>. 3 Animate existence viewed with regard to its duration, one&#x27;s life or continued existence : περὶ ψυχῆς θέον Ἕκτορος Il. 22.161 : ἀρνύμενος ἣν ψυχήν Od. 1.5, ὥς τε περὶ ψυχῆς Od. 9.423. In pl. in reference to a number of persons : ὅσσοι περὶ ψυχέων ἐμάχοντο Od. 22.245. 4 The spirit or soul thought of as distinct from the body and as leaving it at death (cf. θυμός I.1.c) : πολλὰς ψυχὰς Ἄϊδι προΐαψεν Il. 1.3, τὸν δὲ λίπε ψυχή Il. 5.696, ψυχὴ πάλιν ἐλθεῖν οὐ λεϊστή Il. 9.408. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"5\" data-line=\"654\">Il. 5.654=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"445\">Il. 11.445</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"7\" data-line=\"330\">Il. 7.330</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"518\">Il. 14.518</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"453\">Il. 16.453</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"505\">505</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"625\">625</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"16\" data-line=\"856\">856=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"22\" data-line=\"362\">Il. 22.362</a> : ψυχὴ ἀποπταμένη πεπότηται Od. 11.222. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"10\" data-line=\"560\">Od. 10.560=</a> <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"65\">Od. 11.65</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"134\">Od. 14.134</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"14\" data-line=\"426\">426 (</a>of a pig), <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"18\" data-line=\"91\">Od. 18.91</a>. 5 A disembodied spirit, a shade : ψυχὴ Πατροκλῆος Il. 23.65, ψυχαί, εἴδωλα καμόντων <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"72\">72. Cf</a>. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"100\">Il. 23.100</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"106\">106</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"221\">221</a> : ψυχῇ (ψυχὴ) Τειρεσίαο Od. 10.492= <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"10\" data-line=\"565\">565</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"90\">Od. 11.90</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"165\">165</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"251\">Od. 23.251</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"23\" data-line=\"323\">323. Cf</a>. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"10\" data-line=\"530\">Od. 10.530</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"37\">Od. 11.37</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"51\">51</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"84\">84</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"141\">141</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"150\">150</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"205\">205</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"385\">385</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"387\">387</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"467\">467</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"471\">471</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"538\">538</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"541\">541</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"543\">543</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"564\">564</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"11\" data-line=\"567\">567</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"1\">Od. 24.1</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"14\">14</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"15\">15</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"20\">20</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"23\">23</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"35\">35=</a><a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"191\">191</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"100\">100</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"102\">102</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"105\">105</a>, <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"120\">120</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yhfi/s": {"key": "yhfi/s", "head": "ψηφίς", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψηφίς -ῖδος, ἡ. A pebble <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"21\" data-line=\"260\">Il. 21.260</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yeudh/s": {"key": "yeudh/s", "head": "ψευδής", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψευδής [ψεύδομαι.] Breaking one&#x27;s troth. Absol., one guilty of doing this : οὐκ ἐπὶ ψευδέσσι Ζεὺς ἔσσετʼ ἀρωγός <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"iliad\" data-book=\"4\" data-line=\"235\">Il. 4.235</a> (u.l. ψεύδεσσιν; see ψεῦδος 1).</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yhlafa/w": {"key": "yhlafa/w", "head": "†ψηλαφάω", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">†ψηλαφάω Pres. pple. ψηλαφόων. To feel or grope about : χερσὶ ψηλαφόων <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"416\">Od. 9.416</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "ywmo/s": {"key": "ywmo/s", "head": "ψωμός", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψωμός -οῦ, ὁ. A bit or gobbet <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"9\" data-line=\"374\">Od. 9.374</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yuri/h": {"key": "yuri/h", "head": "Ψυρίη", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">Ψυρίη An island northwest of Chios <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"3\" data-line=\"171\">Od. 3.171</a>.</div>", "src": "hompers"}, "yolo/eis": {"key": "yolo/eis", "head": "ψολόεις", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψολόεις -εντος [ψόλος, smoke.] Accompanied by smoke, smoky : κεραυνῷ Od. 23.330. Cf. <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"24\" data-line=\"539\">Od. 24.539</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "ya/mmos": {"key": "ya/mmos", "head": "ψάμμος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψάμμος -ου, ἡ [cf. ψάμαθος.] =ψάμαθος. (1) : γαῖα ψάμμῳ κυανέη <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"12\" data-line=\"243\">Od. 12.243</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}, "yu=xos": {"key": "yu=xos", "head": "ψῦχος", "html": "<div class=\"cunliffe-sense\">ψῦχος τό [ψύχω.] Coolness <a class=\"cunliffe-cite\" href=\"#\" data-work=\"odyssey\" data-book=\"10\" data-line=\"555\">Od. 10.555</a>.</div>", "src": "lex"}}